# Planted probes. HostTestAnalysisEnforcementTest writes these two to prove
# `composer stan` and `composer deptrac` can actually fail, and deletes them
# again; each carries a deliberate defect. They are never part of the tree, so
# ignoring them means a copy left behind by a killed run cannot be committed by
# accident. The test still asserts they are gone, so this hides nothing.
/tests/Feature/HostStanProbe.php
/tests/Feature/HostDeptracProbe.php
Homestead.json
Homestead.yaml
Thumbs.db
